        "source_text": "import TGLExt.V351InverseLimitFiniteMinorants\n#check TGLV350.Regular.scalarInverseLimitWeight_finite_contractions\n#print axioms TGLV350.Regular.scalarInverseLimitWeight_finite_contractions\n#check TGLV350.Regular.scalarInverseLimitWeight_finite_minorants\n#print axioms TGLV350.Regular.scalarInverseLimitWeight_finite_minorants\n",
        "stream_text": "TGLV350.Regular.scalarInverseLimitWeight_finite_contractions (P : TGLExt.SiteProfile) :\n  ∃ E,\n    (∀ (n : ℕ), ‖↑(E n)‖ ≤ 1) ∧\n      (∀ (n : ℕ), TGLV350.Regular.scalarInverseLimitWeight P (TGLV351.positiveSquare P (E n)) < ⊤) ∧\n        ∀ (v : ↥(TGLV350.Regular.RegularHilbert (TGLExt.TowerHilbert P))),\n          Filter.Tendsto (fun n => ↑(E n) v) Filter.atTop (nhds v)\n'TGLV350.Regular.scalarInverseLimitWeight_finite_contractions' depends on axioms: [propext,\n Classical.choice,\n Quot.sound]\nTGLV350.Regular.scalarInverseLimitWeight_finite_minorants (P : TGLExt.SiteProfile)\n  (htr :\n    ∀ (a : ↥(TGLV350.Regular.regularCoreAlgebra P).toStarSubalgebra),\n      TGLV350.Regular.scalarInverseLimitWeight P (TGLV351.positiveSquare P a) =\n        TGLV350.Regular.scalarInverseLimitWeight P (TGLV351.positiveSquare P (star a)))\n  (X : TGLV350.Regular.PositiveCoreInput P) :\n  TGLV350.Regular.scalarInverseLimitWeight P X =\n    ⨆ Y,\n      ⨆ (_ : Y ≤ X),\n        ⨆ (_ : TGLV350.Regular.scalarInverseLimitWeight P Y < ⊤), TGLV350.Regular.scalarInverseLimitWeight P Y\n'TGLV350.Regular.scalarInverseLimitWeight_finite_minorants' depends on axioms: [propext, Classical.choice, Quot.sound]\n"
